! LNUM  = Number of leaf on main axis
! AREAP = Potential area of leaf (cm2)
! AREA1 = Area of leaf on main axis (cm2)
! AREAT = Area of leaves on all axes at leaf position (cm2) 
! AREAS = Area of leaves senesced at leaf position (cm2)
! T#PL  = Tiller number/plant at leaf position
! T#AL  = Tiller number/area(m2) at leaf position
! WFLF  = Water stress factor for leaf (0-1,0=0 stress)
! NFLF  = N stress factor for leaf (0-1,0=0 stress)
! AFLF  = Assimilate factor for leaf (0-1,0=0 no limitation)
! TFLF  = Temperature factor for leaf (0-1,1=0 no limitation)
! DAYSG = Number of days of growth   

